  "releaseNotes": "`RenderToPickable` now returns ALL requested semantics (not just Colors) in `.Textures` — the pickable offscreen pass already renders depth, and `BlitFramebuffer` carries it to the output fbo, so callers reconstructing from depth (GTAO / SSAO) no longer need a second full-scene `RenderTo`.\nSharedTexture (macOS): 16-align IOSurface `bytesPerRow` to satisfy Metal texture validation.",
